defender-easm is the Microsoft Defender External Attack Surface Management vendor ops skill, re-authored
from the chrishuffman5 Defender EASM expert agent into a vault skill with three references. Full-ops scope.
It is the EASM vendor for the family, so it routes the DESIGN / discovery-strategy question back to the
attack-surface-management umbrella (PR 1) and routes CVE scanning + remediation to vulnerability-management
(the EASM-to-VM loop). Skill licensed MIT. VulnMgmt + ASM family PR 2 of 4.

Files folded -> reference mapping:
  chrishuffman5 plugins/security/skills/defender-easm/SKILL.md (Defender EASM expert
    agent: product overview, deployment portal/CLI/Terraform, discovery seeds + groups, asset states +
    labels, risk analysis dashboard + Insight Cards + CVE integration, Azure integration Defender-for-Cloud
    + Sentinel + Logic Apps, API, pricing)
    -> SKILL.md (condensed core: an Azure resource that scans the internet for you; discovery runs from
